### 8. Single Import
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 3,
  "amount": 2000.0,
  "type": "expense",
  "description": "Single import test",
  "txn_date": "2026-10-22",
  "payment_type": "cash"
}

### 10. Sort by amount (highest first)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/transactions/3/sort?by=amount&order=desc

### 11. Sort by date (oldest first)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/transactions/3/sort?by=txn_date&order=asc

### 12. Binary search by amount
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/transactions/3/search?amount=25000

### 13. Top 3 expenses
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/transactions/3/top?k=3

### 14. Top 5 expenses (default)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/transactions/3/top


### Scan receipt
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/scan-receipt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----MyBoundary

------MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="user_id"

3
------MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="receipt.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./receipt.png
------MyBoundary--

### Spending summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/transactions/3/summary